e=6A884EEF"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440 (2).png", "id": "818952757010626", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240098_818952763677292_337638963599190306_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w47TMW2RiqgQ7kNvwHOL7tL&_nc_oc=AdoZDyqO6zZsNZxN_6okgb2Y482PEAPUokp25VqYv-2_R-hUJNrm_3FrUfRNhBVMP_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH9VQTcznAejK180mfa795ix6DD209gRnofJ-oyn1XDNA&oe=6A8841F4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 (2).png", "id": "1300838367963911", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974838_1300838371297244_1125909428722011491_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9TsFYw2cH6MQ7kNvwESD0hf&_nc_oc=Adrf5pIbTreted0TiHNhFJZyKNmnjnGsaskQkR6QVGQxq6AuLoeJPNHTk2CLT33m3O8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEew7gCRjefLDZFuE0cRxm0gS90No_DnrL6zjrC7Exfaw&oe=6A881B8A"}, "display_name": "Interaction World Cube", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Cube control: Players can grab, move, rotate, and arrange cube blocks in 3D space, creating countless creative possibilities.\nFree movement: Explore the virtual world by moving freely in space, allowing players to approach every angle of the environment.\nDiverse worlds: Each world in the application has its own theme and challenges, ranging from simple to complex environments.\nEnvironmental interaction: Cube blocks can interact with elements in the environment, creating interesting effects and outcomes.\nIn-app purchases (IAP): Players can unlock additional new worlds through the in-app purchase system, expanding their gaming experience and exploration.\nVivid graphics: Sharp 3D images and bright colors create an engaging and vibrant VR world.", "short_description": "Interaction World Cube is an innovative and interactive virtual reality (VR) application designed to provide a unique experience for VR headset users. In this virtual world, players explore and 